  "html": "<p>Treasure Chests can be found anywhere. There are usually 3 or  4 chests near to each other except for within <a href=\"/wiki/Dew_Valley\" title=\"Dew Valley\">Dew Valley</a>, where chests only spawn 2 at a time.  Chests drop <a href=\"/wiki/Kings_Coins\" title=\"Kings Coins\">Kings Coins</a>, gold and <a href=\"/wiki/Loot\" title=\"Loot\">Loot</a>.  Chests rarely drop grey items, usually greens and blues, occasionally yellows or purples.  The size and shape of a normal chest does not seem to make any difference in what they drop; however, as of build 150, there are now special chests that drop specific types of items, as well as altars and weapon racks. Boss chests may spawn in the treasure room of a Boss lair.\n</p><p>Beyond <a href=\"/wiki/Dew_Valley\" title=\"Dew Valley\">Dew Valley</a> you can accept <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Relic_Quests\" title=\"Category:Relic Quests\">Relic Quests</a> from <a href=\"/wiki/Tilles_the_Sellout\" title=\"Tilles the Sellout\">Tilles the Sellout</a>.  Relic chests are randomly created as special, and appear yellow rather than brown, but they can be any of the regular shapes.  Mouseover will show Ancient Relic Chest.  These chests may yield relics, but often they spawn a  <a href=\"/wiki/Guardians\" title=\"Guardians\">Guardian</a> who must be fought to gain the Relic.\n</p><p>Here are some common varieties of Treasure Chests (characters shown for size reference only):\n</p>\n<table>\n<tr>\n<td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"thumb tnone\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:152px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Smallchest.JPG\" title=\"Mini Chest\"><img alt=\"Mini Chest\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"223\" src=\"/images/Smallchest.JPG\" width=\"150\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Smallchest.JPG\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Mini Chest</div></div></div></div>\n</td><td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"thumb tnone\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:202px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/SmallLongChest.JPG\" title=\"Small Long Chest\"><img alt=\"Small Long Chest\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"127\" src=\"/images/SmallLongChest.JPG\" width=\"200\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/SmallLongChest.JPG\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Small Long Chest</div></div></div></div>\n</td><td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"thumb tnone\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:202px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/SmallSquareChest.jpg\" title=\"Small Square Chest\"><img alt=\"Small Square Chest\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"153\" src=\"/images/SmallSquareChest.jpg\" width=\"200\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/SmallSquareChest.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Small Square Chest</div></div></div></div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"thumb tnone\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:202px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/SmallRoundChest2.jpg\" title=\"Small Round Chest\"><img alt=\"Small Round Chest\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"201\" src=\"/images/SmallRoundChest2.jpg\" width=\"200\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/SmallRoundChest2.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Small Round Chest</div></div></div></div>\n</td><td><div class=\"center\"><div cla