Chest.PNG\" width=\"126\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Divine_Treasure_Chest.PNG\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Divine Treasure Chest that drops Divine items</div></div></div></div>\n</td><td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"thumb tnone\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:154px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/I.pngce_Treasure_Chest.PNG\" title=\"Ice Treasure Chest that drops Ice items\"><img alt=\"Ice Treasure Chest that drops Ice items\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"122\" src=\"/images/recovered/I.pngce_Treasure_Chest.PNG\" width=\"152\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/recovered/I.pngce_Treasure_Chest.PNG\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Ice Treasure Chest that drops Ice items</div></div></div></div>\n</td><td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"thumb tnone\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:113px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Fire_Treasure_Chest.png\" title=\"Fire Treasure Chest that drops Fire items\"><img alt=\"Fire Treasure Chest that drops Fire items\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"123\" src=\"/images/recovered/Fire_Treasure_Chest.png\" width=\"111\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/recovered/Fire_Treasure_Chest.png\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Fire Treasure Chest that drops Fire items</div></div></div></div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"thumb tnone\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:177px;\"><a class=\"image\