ar that drops Ranger specific items</div></div></div></div>\n</td><td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"thumb tnone\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:188px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Mage_Altar.PNG\" title=\"Mage Altar that drops Mage specific items\"><img alt=\"Mage Altar that drops Mage specific items\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"195\" src=\"/images/Mage_Altar.PNG\" width=\"186\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Mage_Altar.PNG\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Mage Altar that drops Mage specific items</div></div></div></div>\n</td><td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"thumb tnone\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:202px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Fighter_Altar.PNG\" title=\"Fighter Altar that drops Fighter specific items\"><img alt=\"Fighter Altar that drops Fighter specific items\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"251\" src=\"/images/Fighter_Altar.PNG\" width=\"200\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Fighter_Altar.PNG\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Fighter Altar that drops Fighter specific items</div></div></div></div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"thumb tnone\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:202px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Great_weapon_rack.png\" title=\"Great Weapon Rack drops 2-4 weapons, at least one yellow or purple\"><img alt=\"Great Weapon Rack drops 2-4 weapons, at least one yellow or purple\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"161\" src=\"/images/recovered/Great_weapon_rack.png\" width=\"200\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/recovered/Great_weapon_rack.png\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Great Weapon Rack drops 2-4 weapons, at least one yellow or purple</div></div></div></div>\n</td><td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"thumb tnone\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:135px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Normal_weapon_rack.png\" title=\"Weapon Rack drops 2-4 weapons, mostly green and blue\"><img alt=\"Weapon Rack drops 2-4 weapons, mostly green and blue\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"161\" src=\"/images/recovered/Normal_weapon_rack.png\" width=\"133\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/recovered/Normal_weapon_rack.png\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Weapon Rack drops 2-4 weapons, mostly green and blue</div></div></div></div>\n</td><td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"thumb tnone\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:128px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Sword_stone.PNG\" title=\"The Sword in the Stone drops 1 sword, mostly purple\"><img alt=\"The Sword in the Stone drops 1 sword, mostly purple\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"172\" src=\"/images/Sword_stone.PNG\" width=\"126\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Sword_stone.PNG\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>The Sword in the Stone drops 1 sword, mostly purple</div></div></div></div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"thumb tnone\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:80px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Radical_sword.PNG\" title=\"The Radical Sword in the Stone d